      "area": "One-stop install, upgrade, initialization resume, administrator reset and restoration",
      "inspection": "Freshly traced shell launchers, operator/CLI install/update/reset/recovery routing and initialize-recorded identity/source binding, with unchanged account/install durability analysis retained by exact hashes. Operator upgrade orders control-update then config-layer-migrate then application update and stops on failure. Candidate-budget maintenance remains explicit and separately verified. Account reset publishes once and reports unverified login without silently reverting credentials."
    },
